{"id":"120209","t":{"th":"เกิดใหม่เป็นนางร้ายจะเลือกทางไหนก็หายนะ All Routes Lead to Doom! X","ro":"Otome Game no Hametsu Flag shika Nai Akuyaku Reijou ni Tensei shiteshimatta… X","en":"My Next Life as a Villainess: All Routes Lead to Doom! X","na":"乙女ゲームの破滅フラグしかない悪役令嬢に転生してしまった…Ｘ","thShared":true},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx120209-7eQk3UKmkQun.jpg","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx120209-7eQk3UKmkQun.jpg","color":"#e47850","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/120209-Zq9pKVVxG6rF.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":12,"dur":24,"season":"SUMMER","year":2021,"start":"2021-07-03","country":"JP","genres":["Comedy","Fantasy","Romance","Slice of Life"],"score":71,"pop":80017,"studio":"SILVER LINK.","desc":"Katarina Claes, the daughter of a duke, regains her memories from a previous life after hitting her head on a rock. The world she lives in now is the world of Fortune Lover, the otome game she was hooked on in her previous life, and she is now the villainess who interferes with the heroine's love story! The happy ending prepared for Katarina in the game is being exiled from the country, and the bad ending, she gets killed... but she's determined to avoid all destruction flags and claim a happy future for herself! And after she succeeds in avoiding those flags, a new crisis awaits?! The curtain rises once again on this flirtatious romantic comedy!","descTh":"Katarina Claes ลูกสาวของดยุคฟื้นความทรงจำของเธอจากชาติก่อนหลังจากหัวกระแทกก้อนหิน โลกที่เธออาศัยอยู่ตอนนี้คือโลกแห่ง Fortune Lover เกมโอโตเมะที่เธอหลงใหลในชาติที่แล้ว และตอนนี้ เธอคือนางร้ายที่ขัดขวางเรื่องราวความรักของนางเอก! ตอนจบที่มีความสุขที่เตรียมไว้สำหรับ Katarina ในเกมกำลังถูกเนรเทศออกจากประเทศ และตอนจบที่ไม่ดีเธอถูกฆ่า... แต่เธอมุ่งมั่นที่จะหลีกเลี่ยงธงแห่งการทำลายล้างทั้งหมดและเรียกร้องอนาคตที่มีความสุขสำหรับตัวเธอเอง! และหลังจากที่เธอประสบความสำเร็จในการหลีกเลี่ยงธงเหล่านั้น วิกฤติครั้งใหม่กำลังรออยู่! ม่านเปิดขึ้นอีกครั้งกับโรแมนติกคอมเมดี้สุดน่ารักเรื่องนี้!","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":null,"descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"thB_uxz3rck","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/120209","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/42282","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"muse_th","r":"TH","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLIa05JMgYhhbwaHvCY_octZzXTjaeenB8","lang":"sub","eps":[["7","y:7XFQg5z1IW4",1667200881,"~",null,null,{"d":1416,"sk":[[14.4,101.7],[1323.4,1412.7]]}],["8","y:IEozrg1smpg",1667200881,"~",null,null,{"d":1400,"sk":[[0.5,87.7],[1299.6,1390.3]]}],["9","y:exffMP7QfX0",1667200881,"~",null,null,{"d":1400,"sk":[[17.5,104.8],[1310.5,1397.7]]}],["10","y:MueB0x2oJl4",1667200881,"~",null,null,{"d":1401,"sk":[[13.5,100.7],[1308.5,1397.7]]}],["11","y:4-ZQtF2DaaA",1667200881,"~",null,null,{"d":1401,"sk":[[955.9,984.8]]}],["12","y:Wkbqu5eHh6E",1667200881,"~",null,null,{"d":1401,"sk":[[125.5,212.7]],"fin":1}],["ตอนพิเศษ","y:5TijEv8eng0",1667200881,"~",null,"13",{"d":1706,"sk":[[0.5,87.0],[1616.1,1703.3]],"sp":1}],["6","y:XV-cOzbjfYo",1636203608,"x",null,null,{"d":1415,"sk":[[41.4,128.6],[1310.0,1405.2]]}],["5","y:UIz0t-zTa_I",1636117209,"x",null,null,{"d":1415,"sk":[[21.4,108.6],[1313.4,1405.2]]}],["4","y:T2CZjjsKi6c",1636030810,"x",null,null,{"d":1415,"sk":[[31.4,118.7],[1325.4,1412.6]]}],["3","y:kbBzmXtGPeY",1635944410,"x",null,null,{"d":1415,"sk":[[1325.3,1412.5]]}],["2","y:y_V5VaYHc2A",1635858010,"x",null,null,{"d":1415,"sk":[[20.8,108.6],[1325.3,1412.5]]}],["1","y:xyuIcOfJZV8",1635771610,"x",null,null,{"d":1415,"sk":[[1325.5,1412.7]]}]],"pat":"ทุกวัน 21:00 น."},{"p":"bilibili","r":"TH","u":"https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/1010520","lang":"sub","eps":[["12","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/1010520/10449184",1631899500,"x","b:3fcf46693636c1daf5df14cce1f50152e7b8aa11.png",null,{"fin":1}],["11","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/1010520/10449060",1631294700,"x","b:29de6c77e2153182115495089071f47246f3b4a8.jpg",null,{}],["10","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/p